      "content": "Consider the product $f = uv$, where $u$ and $v$ or $v$ may be variables or functions of variables. Here $\\partial f/\\partial v = u$, $\\partial f/\\partial u = v$, $\\partial^2 f/\\partial u \\partial v = 1$, and all other partial derivatives are zero. By including all terms involving these three nonzero partials in the application of Equation A1.4a, we obtain the expectation",
